OL,3,GNEWSAMP opposes council's decision to
OL,4,Aclose care homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP and a senior councillor have said
OL,7,Fthey oppose a local authority's
OL,8,Fdecision to close its last remaining
OL,9,Fcare homes.
OL,11,FLucy Rigby, the Labour MP for
OL,12,FNorthampton North, and Sally Keeble,
OL,13,Fwho leads West Northamptonshire's
OL,14,FLabour group, said they were "deeply
OL,15,Fdisappointed" at plans to close
OL,16,FSouthfields House and Obelisk House.
OL,18,FOn Tuesday, West Northamptonshire
OL,19,FCouncil's cabinet approved proposals to
OL,20,F"reshape" several council-run
OL,21,Fprovisions, affecting 250 people.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
