OL,3,GNEWSAMP opposes council's decision to
OL,4,Aclose care homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the Reform UK-led
OL,7,Fcouncil said the two care homes were
OL,8,Fmore than 40 years old and "no longer
OL,9,Fmeet modern standards for care
OL,10,Fenvironments".
